Third-party model licenses
---------------------------
Pretrained face models downloaded at runtime carry their own licenses,
separate from this repo's MIT license:

- YuNet face detection (auto-downloaded from opencv_zoo on first run) —
  see https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo for its license terms.
- InsightFace inswapper models (optional, user-supplied) — the InsightFace
  project notes its code is MIT but pretrained models are for non-commercial
  research; contact InsightFace about licensing before commercial use.
- Demo media credits and terms: see demo/SOURCES.txt.
